id: pm-3czc4m
title: "Adopt the 2026-11-16 Dependabot updates: knip 6.44.2, marked 18.1.3, six GitHub Actions patch releases and @sentry/node 10.78.0, holding the Sentry 11 major"
description: "Dependabot opened three update PRs on 2026-11-16 after the 7-day cooldown. PR 1737 bumps knip 6.44.1 to 6.44.2 and marked 18.1.2 to 18.1.3, and is green. PR 1738 brings six GitHub Actions patch updates: pnpm/action-setup 6.1.1, github/codeql-action init/analyze/upload-sarif 4.39.3, CodSpeedHQ/action 5.6.3 and softprops/action-gh-release 3.0.4. It is red because tests/integration/ci-workflow-contract.spec.ts pins the CodSpeed and action-gh-release commit SHAs. PR 1739 bumps @sentry/node 10.76.2 to 11.11.0, a major, and is red because Sentry 11 removed the enableLogs option. A trial adoption of 11.11.0 showed a deeper blocker, filed as pm-jy61mz: Sentry 11 pulls @sentry/bundler-plugins and native oxc-parser bindings into pm's runtime closure (42 to 88 packages), and the package-artifact gate cannot stage them. This chore therefore adopts knip, marked and the six actions, moves the contract pins, and takes @sentry/node to 10.78.0, the newest 10.x, released 2026-10-28 and past the cooldown. It adds a Dependabot ignore rule for @sentry/node semver-major updates that points at pm-jy61mz, refreshes the runtime lock, and closes the three Dependabot PRs as superseded. Duplicate check: searched dependency update sentry node major knip marked github actions; the earlier refresh chores (pm-2h8ohq, pm-98f0ec, pm-4dz7) are closed."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: dependencies,github-actions,quality,sentry
