acceptance_criteria: "knip 6.44.2, marked 18.1.3 and @sentry/node 10.78.0 are in package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml and the runtime lock; All six GitHub Actions updates are applied and the workflow contract spec pins the new commit SHAs; Dependabot ignores @sentry/node semver-major updates with a pointer to pm-jy61mz; Full CI, quality:static, the package-artifact gate and the Sentry instrumentation specs pass; Dependabot PRs 1737, 1738 and 1739 are closed as superseded with a link to the adopting PR"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "knip 6.44.2, marked 18.1.3 and @sentry/node 10.78.0 in package.json, the lockfile and the runtime lock; six GitHub Actions patch releases applied, with the workflow contract SHA pins moved; Dependabot ignores @sentry/node majors until pm-jy61mz; Dependabot PRs 1737-1739 closed as superseded"
expected_result: "All matured updates land through one reviewed PR without behavior change, and the major is held with a documented reason"
actual_result: "quality:static, package-artifact, retrieval-eval and 185/185 Sentry/telemetry/contract specs pass on the branch; the Sentry 11 trial failed package-artifact and the stderr contract, so 10.78.0 was adopted"
